---
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Use Cases — Syntila"
  description="See how people use Syntila for personal projects, family plans, team work, and software development."
>
  <Section>
    <Container>
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="Use cases"
        title="Make progress with AI, on your own or together."
        description="Build a personal project, plan a family trip, or work through a team decision with your AI tools and conversations in one place."
        headingLevel={1}
      />

      <nav class="usecase-jump-links" aria-label="Jump to use case">
        <a href="#personal">Personal Projects</a>
        <a href="#family">Friends &amp; Family</a>
        <a href="#teams">Teams &amp; Companies</a>
        <a href="#engineering">Software &amp; Engineering</a>
      </nav>

      <div id="personal" class="usecase-detail-section">
        <div class="usecase-detail-header">
          <span class="usecase-badge usecase-badge--dev">Personal Projects</span>
          <h2>Make space for your own ideas.</h2>
          <p class="usecase-intro">Create a Space for yourself and work with your AI tools across projects and everyday tasks. Invite others whenever you want their input.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="usecase-grid">
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Build a project</h3>
            <p>Develop an app or website with coding tools on your connected computer.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-4-4"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Research and learn</h3>
            <p>Explore a topic and keep questions, answers, and findings together in a Thread.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18m-13 5 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Plan and organize</h3>
            <p>Work through a trip, home project, or important decision with AI at hand.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Continue on the go</h3>
            <p>Read progress and send requests from the web or mobile while your connected computer is awake and online.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1: Friends & Family -->
      <div id="family" class="usecase-detail-section">
        <div class="usecase-detail-header">
          <span class="usecase-badge usecase-badge--family">Friends &amp; Family</span>
          <h2>Think, plan, and decide together.</h2>
          <p class="usecase-intro">
            Stop sending screenshots of chatbot answers back and forth in messaging apps. One person connects their computer, and everyone else joins in the Syntila app to ask, read, and decide in the same Thread.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="usecase-scenario usecase-scenario--family">
          <div class="usecase-scenario__intro"><span>In a shared Thread</span><strong>Lisbon weekend</strong><p>A shared trip, with people and AI working in context.</p></div>
          <div class="usecase-scenario__flow" aria-hidden="true"><span>Flights</span><span>Stay</span><span>Itinerary</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="usecase-grid">
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.3c.4-.2.6-.6.5-1.1z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Vacation &amp; Travel Planning</h3>
            <p>Compare flights, stays, and transit, then plan the trip together in one Thread.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Home &amp; Renovation Spaces</h3>
            <p>Compare quotes and materials, discuss the budget, and keep decisions together.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Major Life &amp; Purchasing Decisions</h3>
            <p>Research big purchases or schools and ask AI Workers for second opinions.</p>
          </div>


        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Teams & Companies -->
      <div id="teams" class="usecase-detail-section">
        <div class="usecase-detail-header">
          <span class="usecase-badge usecase-badge--teams">Teams &amp; Companies</span>
          <h2>Collaborative intelligence for knowledge work.</h2>
          <p class="usecase-intro">
            Give your product, marketing, operations, and leadership teams one place where discussions, prompts, research, and decisions stay together.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="usecase-scenario usecase-scenario--teams">
          <div class="usecase-scenario__intro"><span>In a shared Thread</span><strong>Market research</strong><p>A shared decision, with people and AI working in context.</p></div>
          <div class="usecase-scenario__flow" aria-hidden="true"><span>Findings</span><span>Compare</span><span>Decision</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="usecase-grid">
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Market &amp; Competitive Research</h3>
            <p>Have several Workers research in parallel and combine their findings into one comparison.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 3a2.85 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Strategy &amp; Content Collaboration</h3>
            <p>Draft specs, proposals, and launch copy alongside team feedback and AI revisions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 0 9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0 6.74-2.74L21 16"/><path d="M16 21h5v-5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Multi-Worker Deliberation</h3>
            <p>Compare answers from different AI Workers in the same Thread, with shared context.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Scoped Access &amp; Attribution</h3>
            <p>Choose member roles and available Workers for each Space, and remove access when needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Software & Engineering -->
      <div id="engineering" class="usecase-detail-section">
        <div class="usecase-detail-header">
          <span class="usecase-badge usecase-badge--dev">Software &amp; Engineering Teams</span>
          <h2>Turn discussions into verified code.</h2>
          <p class="usecase-intro">
            Connect your development machines and coding agents through Syntila Workspace. The team discusses a change in a Thread, a Worker implements it on the connected machine, and the tests and review are recorded for everyone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="usecase-scenario usecase-scenario--engineering">
          <div class="usecase-scenario__intro"><span>In a shared Thread</span><strong>Improve onboarding</strong><p>A shared change, with people and AI working in context.</p></div>
          <div class="usecase-scenario__flow" aria-hidden="true"><span>Plan</span><span>Implement</span><span>Verify</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="usecase-grid">
          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Coding Agent Orchestration</h3>
            <p>Send coding tasks to Workers on a connected machine, using approved tools.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Separate Threads for each task</h3>
            <p>Keep discussions and context for different engineering tasks in their own Threads.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2v17.5c0 1.4-1.1 2.5-2.5 2.5s-2.5-1.1-2.5-2.5V2"/><path d="M8.5 2h7"/><path d="M9 16h6"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Full Cycle Verification</h3>
            <p>Run Plan → Implement → Verify and keep the results in the Thread.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="usecase-card">
            <span class="usecase-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Local Workspace Execution</h3>
            <p>Keep repositories, build tools, and provider logins on your connected computer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Action -->
      <div class="actions actions--center section-block-gap-lg">
        <Button href="https://app.syntila.app" label="Open Syntila" event="cta.open_app" />
        <Button href="/workers/" label="Explore AI &amp; Workers" variant="secondary" />
        <Button href="/how-it-works/" label="See how it works" variant="secondary" event="navigation.how_it_works" />
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</SiteLayout>

